      "content": "an antihistamine for a headache?? i dont think that'll do much lol. i usually just take advil when i hurt, is it really that big of a deal with my stomach? i mean it's just some heartburn, it's not like i'm dying or anything. can i just take a couple of ibuprofen to get this headache to go away?",
